  data: {
    LLM: 'Standard 7-card stud deal with card exchanges. After the fifth card betting round, each player can optionally exchange one card. After the sixth card betting round, another exchange round occurs. Each exchange can involve either a face-down card or a face-up card. The seventh card and final betting round follow standard 7-card stud. Maximum 6 players to ensure sufficient cards.',
    Player: 'Standard 7-card stud deal with card exchanges. After the fifth card betting round, each player can optionally exchange one card. After the sixth card betting round, another exchange round occurs. Each exchange can involve either a face-down card or a face-up card. The seventh card and final betting round follow standard 7-card stud. Maximum 6 players to ensure sufficient cards.',
    objective: 'Make the best five-card poker hand from seven cards; high hand wins the pot.',
    gameplay: 'Standard 7-card stud deal with card exchanges. After the fifth card betting round, each player can optionally exchange one card. After the sixth card betting round, another exchange round occurs. Each exchange can involve either a face-down card or a face-up card. The seventh card and final betting round follow standard 7-card stud. Maximum 6 players to ensure sufficient cards.',
    keyRules: [
      'Deal follows 7-card stud structure (2 down, 1 up, then 3 more up, then 1 down)',
      'After 5-card street betting, optional single-card exchange for each player',
      'After 6-card street betting, another optional single-card exchange',
      'Can exchange face-down card for face-down, or face-up for face-up',
      'Sixth card dealt face-up, seventh card dealt face-down',
      'Standard poker hand ranking; high hand wins',
      'Maximum 6 players; with five or fewer a seventh face-down card is dealt',
    ],
