    setup: {
      players: 'Two to six players. Six is the maximum for this variant so the deck suffices for the deal and two optional single-card exchange rounds; with five or fewer players a seventh face-down card may be dealt as in standard seven-card stud. Best with five or six players for balance of action and card availability.',
      deck: 'Standard 52-card deck. No jokers.',
      equipment: 'Chips; table space.',
      dealing: 'Same as 7-card stud. Betting structure often Pot-Limit or Spread-Limit (local rules).',
